[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0076","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14322","title":"Pallets Werkzeug SharedDataMiddleware 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Pallets Werkzeug 是一款广泛应用于 Python Web 开发的基础工具库，其 SharedDataMiddleware 组件在 Windows 平台下对包含驱动器盘符（如 C:）的文件路径处理不当，导致攻击者可通过构造包含 Windows 驱动器格式路径的目录遍历请求，绕过路径安全检查，读取服务器上受限目录中的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 0.15.5 版本之前的所有 Werkzeug 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，当目标服务器运行在 Windows 环境下并启用了静态文件服务时，即可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发路径遍历，造成敏感信息泄露。Pallets 官方已在 0.15.5 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14322"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-28T13:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Pallets Werkzeug 升级至 0.15.5 或更高版本（执行 pip install --upgrade werkzeug）。若暂无法升级，建议临时禁用 Windows 环境下 SharedDataMiddleware 的静态文件托管功能，或在前端反向代理层过滤含盘符（如 C:）的请求路径，并在防火墙或 WAF 中阻断路径穿越特征。同时排查 Flask 等依赖框架的版本兼容性，确保依赖链整体修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163398/Pallets-Werkzeug-0.15.4-Path-Traversal.html","https://palletsprojects.com/blog/werkzeug-0-15-5-released/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50101","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14322.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14322.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2019/CVE-2019-14322.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2019/CVE-2019-14322.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14322.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-14322.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14322-3847.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14322-3850.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14322-3848.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14322-3849.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14322-3845.yaml","https://github.com/EmreOvunc/Odoo-12.0-LFI-Vulnerabilities","https://github.com/sergiovks/CVE-2019-14322","https://github.com/faisalfs10x/CVE-2019-14322-scanner","https://github.com/faisalfs10x/http-vuln-cve2019-14322.nse"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0076.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0076.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0309","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11708","title":"Mozilla Firefox Prompt:Open IPC 沙箱逃逸漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 和 Thunderbird 的父进程与子进程之间通过 Prompt:Open IPC 消息传递参数时存在输入验证不足漏洞。攻击者可在子进程被攻陷后，利用该漏洞向非沙箱父进程发送特制的 Prompt:Open 消息，使父进程打开攻击者控制的 Web 内容，从而实现沙箱逃逸。结合其他漏洞利用链，攻击者可在用户系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Firefox ESR 60.7.2 之前版本、Firefox 67.0.4 之前版本及 Thunderbird 60.7.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Mozilla 已在 2019 年 7 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11708"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-23T14:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 67.0.4 及以上版本、Firefox ESR 至 60.7.2 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 60.7.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可考虑在浏览器沙箱外额外启用应用隔离（如 Windows Sandbox 或 AppContainer）以限制子进程提权后的影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155592/Mozilla-Firefox-Windows-64-Bit-Chain-Exploit.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1559858","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201908-12","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2019-19/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2019-20/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11708","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11708.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2019/11xxx/CVE-2019-11708.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9810.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11708.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-11708.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-11708.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-11708.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2019/CVE-2019-11708.json","https://github.com/KomaVR/CYBER-FORGE/blob/365751de6565f1c5a12b58151293ee3ae53f0d37/site/content/tools/cve-2019-11708.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-11708.json","https://github.com/0vercl0k/CVE-2019-11708","https://github.com/Sp0pielar/CVE-2019-9791"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0309.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0309.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0308","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11707","title":"Mozilla Firefox Array.pop 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 的 JavaScript 引擎在 Array.pop 方法中存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 JavaScript 对象，利用 JIT 编译过程中的类型推断错误，使引擎错误地将一种类型对象当作另一种类型处理，从而破坏内存布局。成功利用此漏洞可实现任意代码执行，完全控制用户系统。该漏洞已被发现在野利用，攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，无需额外权限。影响 Firefox 67.0.3 之前版本、Firefox ESR 60.7.1 之前版本及 Thunderbird 60.7.2 之前版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11707"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-23T14:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 67.0.3 及以上版本、Firefox ESR 至 60.7.1 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 60.7.2 及以上版本。该漏洞已遭在野利用，须优先修复。如无法立即升级，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用 NoScript 等扩展限制不可信站点脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1544386","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201908-12","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2019-18/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2019-20/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11707","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50691","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11707.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/8b4078d62a74c93dc4c23d215ab5f6afbd5639cd/2019/CVE-2019-11707.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-11707.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9810.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2019/CVE-2019-11707.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11707.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-11707.md","https://github.com/forrest-orr/Exploits/blob/86e588f2c688cfea7ddd77f6bdc9b341c32eb579/Standalone/CVE-2019-11707/Forrest_Orr_CVE-2019-11707_64-bit.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-11707.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-11707.md","https://github.com/vigneshsrao/CVE-2019-11707","https://github.com/flabbergastedbd/cve-2019-11707","https://github.com/CosminGGeorgescu/CVE-2019-11707-PoC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0308.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0308.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0070","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14206","title":"WordPress Nevma Adaptive Images插件任意文件删除漏洞","description":"WordPress Nevma Adaptive Images 插件 0.6.67 之前版本中存在任意文件删除漏洞。该插件通过 adaptive-images-script.php 处理图片请求时，未对 $_REQUEST['adaptive-images-settings'] 参数进行充分过滤，允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过 HTTP GET 请求直接覆盖插件内部配置变量。攻击者可利用该漏洞控制 source_file、cache_dir、request_uri 等参数，结合插件缓存清理机制构造恶意路径，实现删除服务器上任意文件（如 wp-config.php），进而结合本地文件包含（LFI）漏洞实现远程代码执行。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14206"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-21T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:17:56Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 Adaptive Images 升级到 0.6.67 或更高版本（当前最新为 0.6.73）。在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面找到 Adaptive Images，点击「更新」即可。如无法立即更新，可临时停用该插件，或删除插件目录下 adaptive-images-script.php 中第 62-65 行对 `$_REQUEST['adaptive-images-settings']` 的全局变量覆盖逻辑，阻止攻击者通过请求参数注入任意配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/markgruffer/markgruffer.github.io/blob/master/_posts/2019-07-19-adaptive-images-for-wordpress-0-6-66-lfi-rce-file-deletion.markdown","https://markgruffer.github.io/2019/07/19/adaptive-images-for-wordpress-0-6-66-lfi-rce-file-deletion.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/adaptive-images/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9468","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14206.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14206.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2019/CVE-2019-14206.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14206.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/60da8fc5d75736d782765eb922eb4d5875f1de92/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-14206.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/086426bef313267803353e4e1e756713fe1da650/2019/CVE-2019-14206.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14206.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/nevma/adaptive_images/CVE-2019-14206.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-14206.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/60da8fc5d75736d782765eb922eb4d5875f1de92/data/2019/CVE-2019-14206-developerfred_cve-2019-14206-poc.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-14206.md","https://github.com/developerfred/cve-2019-14206-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0070.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0070.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0069","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14205","title":"WordPress Adaptive Images 插件任意文件读取漏洞","description":"WordPress Adaptive Images 插件（版本低于 0.6.67）中存在本地文件包含漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 adaptive-images-script.php 文件传递 `$_REQUEST['adaptive-images-settings']['source_file']` 参数，利用路径遍历攻击读取服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、系统敏感文件等，可能导致进一步的信息泄露和攻击面扩大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14205"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-21T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:17:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Adaptive Images 插件升级至 0.6.67 或更高版本（当前最新版 0.6.73），在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面点击更新即可。如无法立即升级，可暂时停用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含 `adaptive-images-settings` 参数的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/markgruffer/markgruffer.github.io/blob/master/_posts/2019-07-19-adaptive-images-for-wordpress-0-6-66-lfi-rce-file-deletion.markdown","https://markgruffer.github.io/2019/07/19/adaptive-images-for-wordpress-0-6-66-lfi-rce-file-deletion.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/adaptive-images/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9468","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14205.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14205.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14205.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-14205.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3826.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3829.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3830.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3823.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3827.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14205-3822.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-14205-3828.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0054","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12725","title":"Zeroshell 3.9.0 x509view 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Zeroshell 3.9.0 及以下版本的 Web 应用在处理 HTTP 参数时未对输入进行充分过滤，导致操作系统命令注入漏洞。具体而言，位于 `/cgi-bin/kerbynet` 的 x509view 功能在解析 `x509type` 等参数时未对换行符等特殊字符进行转义，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在参数中注入换行符（`%0A`）拼接并执行任意操作系统命令。此外，Apache 用户在 `/etc/sudoers` 中被配置为无需密码即可以 root 身份执行 `/bin/tar` 命令，攻击者可利用此配置结合 tar 的 `--checkpoint-action` 选项实现权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响所有暴露在互联网上的 Zeroshell 3.9.0 设备，CVSS v3 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者只需向目标发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求即可完成利用，无需任何凭据，且可利用 nuclei 模板或公开 exploit 脚本一键获取服务器 root 权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12725"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-19T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:19Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Zeroshell 升级至 3.9.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 x509view 脚本的 HTTP 参数注入漏洞。升级前请备份配置数据，升级后验证 Web 管理界面无法通过未授权参数执行系统命令。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层对 /cgi-bin/kerbynet 的 x509view 请求进行过滤，或临时限制 Web 管理界面的公网访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160211/ZeroShell-3.9.0-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162561/ZeroShell-3.9.0-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://www.tarlogic.com/advisories/zeroshell-rce-root.txt","https://zeroshell.org/blog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49862","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12725.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2019/CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12725.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-12725-3798.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-12725-3800.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-12725-3801.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/ZeroShell 3.9.0 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/network/zeroshell/CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/iot/ZeroShell/ZeroShell 3.9.0 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/iot/ZeroShell-3.9.0-远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2019-12725.md","https://github.com/sma11new/PocList","https://github.com/hev0x/CVE-2019-12725-Command-Injection","https://github.com/givemefivw/CVE-2019-12725","https://github.com/YZS17/CVE-2019-12725","https://github.com/gougou123-hash/CVE-2019-12725"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0700","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1579","title":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 的 GlobalProtect Portal 或 GlobalProtect Gateway 接口存在输入验证错误漏洞（CWE-134：外部可控格式字符串），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 GlobalProtect 服务发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 PAN-OS 7.1.18 及更早版本、PAN-OS 8.0.11-h1 及更早版本、PAN-OS 8.1.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Palo Alto Networks 已在 PAN-OS 7.1.19、8.0.12、8.1.3 及更高版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1579"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-19T22:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:47Z","remediation":"立即将 PAN-OS 升级至 7.1.19 及以上、8.0.12 及以上或 8.1.3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，请将威胁防护内容更新至 8173 或更高版本，并确保在 GlobalProtect 门户和网关接口的流量上启用并强制执行威胁预防策略。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，应优先修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109310","https://devco.re/blog/2019/07/17/attacking-ssl-vpn-part-1-PreAuth-RCE-on-Palo-Alto-GlobalProtect-with-Uber-as-case-study/","https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2019-0010","https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2019-1579","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47693","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47692","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1579.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1579.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1579.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15799.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15791.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15792.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15790.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-1579.md","https://github.com/longuan/longuan.github.io/blob/38ef80c3b362e08fd8d74c91ab170f8467fa3367/_posts/2020-07-10-exp-for-CVE-2019-1579.md","https://github.com/securifera/CVE-2019-1579/blob/949524379136ce5258641309d90c48dc20a4c368/CVE-2019-1579_8.0.7_mips.py","https://github.com/securifera/CVE-2019-1579","https://github.com/Elsfa7-110/CVE-2019-1579"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0700.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0700.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0031","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1010287","title":"Timesheet Next Gen 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Timesheet Next Gen 1.5.3 及更早版本的登录页面 login.php 第 40 行和第 54 行存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 redirect 参数，诱使受害者点击特制 URL 后，在受害者浏览器中执行任意 HTML 和 JavaScript 代码，导致会话劫持、钓鱼攻击或敏感信息窃取。攻击无需认证，但需用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1010287"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-17T21:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:56Z","remediation":"升级 Timesheet Next Gen 至 r506 或更高版本，该版本已完全移除 login.php 中的 redirect 参数，消除了反射型 XSS 注入点。如无法升级，手动编辑 login.php，删除第 40 行 `$redirect = isset($_REQUEST[\"redirect\"]) ? $_REQUEST[\"redirect\"] : \"\";` 及第 54 行 `<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"redirect\" value=\"<?php echo $redirect; ?>\" />`，并将第 48 行 `header(\"Location: $_REQUEST[redirect]\");` 替换为 `gotoStartPage();`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceforge.net/p/tsheetx/code/497/tree/branches/legacy/login.php#l40","https://sourceforge.net/p/tsheetx/discussion/779083/thread/7fcb52f696/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010287.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-1010287.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010287.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-1010287.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-1010287-3698.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010287-3697.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010287-3696.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010287-3694.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-1010287/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-1010287.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010287.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010287.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0031.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0031.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0506","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13272","title":"Linux Linux内核 ptrace本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 5.1.17 之前版本中的 ptrace_link 函数（kernel/ptrace.c）存在权限管理缺陷，在处理进程间 ptrace 关系建立时未正确记录凭证信息。本地低权限用户可利用父子进程关系中的特定场景，通过父进程降权后调用 execve 的时机，结合 Polkit 的 pkexec 辅助程序与 PTRACE_TRACEME 机制，绕过内核权限检查实现提权至 root。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响内核版本的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。此外，对象生命周期问题也可能导致内核崩溃。SELinux deny_ptrace 策略可在部分环境中作为临时缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13272"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-17T13:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:16:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.1.17 或更高版本（如 5.2.x 系列），各发行版对应：Ubuntu 安装 5.1.17+ 内核包，CentOS/RHEL 7 升级至 kernel-3.10.0-1062.el7，Debian 升级至 4.19.67-1。如无法立即升级，可启用 SELinux 并设置 deny_ptrace=1 作为临时缓解，或通过 grub 内核参数添加 `ptrace=off` 禁用 ptrace 系统调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153663/Linux-PTRACE_TRACEME-Broken-Permission-Object-Lifetime-Handling.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153702/Slackware-Security-Advisory-Slackware-14.2-kernel-Updates.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154245/Kernel-Live-Patch-Security-Notice-LSN-0054-1.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154957/Linux-Polkit-pkexec-Helper-PTRACE_TRACEME-Local-Root.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156929/Linux-PTRACE_TRACEME-Local-Root.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/165051/Linux-Kernel-5.1.x-PTRACE_TRACEME-pkexec-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:2405","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:2411","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:2809","https://bugs.chromium.org/p/project-zero/issues/detail?id=1903","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1730895","https://bugzilla.suse.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1140671","https://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v5.x/ChangeLog-5.1.17","https://git.kernel.org/cgit/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=6994eefb0053799d2e07cd140df6c2ea106c41ee","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/6994eefb0053799d2e07cd140df6c2ea106c41ee","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2019/07/msg00022.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2019/07/msg00023.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/OGRK5LYWBJ4E4SRI4DKX367NHYSI3VOH/","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Jul/30","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Jul/33","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20190806-0001/","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K91025336","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K91025336?utm_source=f5support&amp%3Butm_medium=RSS","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4093-1/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4094-1/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4095-1/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4117-1/","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4118-1/","https://www.debian.org/security/2019/dsa-4484","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-13272","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47543","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13272.md","https://github.com/k8gege/K8tools/blob/5aca0cef8bba0f00a001eb1f4f71b380205c4b8d/CVE-2019-13272.c","https://github.com/Al1ex/LinuxEelvation/blob/69cee23442f742c50809f75803b4ebca959f9927/CVE-2019-13272/CVE-2019-13272.c","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2019-13272/readme.md","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2019-13272/exp.c","https://github.com/evdenis/cvehound/blob/511f9c5ecf31bb64e38ca09449dda75c5c8c24e2/cvehound/cve/CVE-2019-13272.cocci","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-13272/blob/2590cfbe05b4f8120f59abb3876815e0463be034/CVE-2019-13272.c","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-13272.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-5763.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/2019/CVE-2019-13272-oneoy_CVE-2019-13272.md","https://github.com/Al1ex/LinuxEelvation","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-13272","https://github.com/Cyc1eC/CVE-2019-13272","https://github.com/oneoy/CVE-2019-13272","https://github.com/josemlwdf/CVE-2019-13272"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0409","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12991","title":"Citrix SD-WAN Appliance 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN 和 NetScaler SD-WAN 设备存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-78 命令注入），经过身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向管理界面发送特制请求绕过认证机制，进而注入系统命令并以 root 权限执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者利用该漏洞可完全控制目标设备，导致敏感信息泄露、系统配置篡改或服务中断。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12991"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级至 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级至 10.0.8 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在防火墙上限制对 SD-WAN 管理接口（默认端口 443/22）的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并禁用 WAN 侧对管理界面的直接访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153638/Citrix-SD-WAN-Appliance-10.2.2-Authentication-Bypass-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-32","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-12991","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47112","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-12991.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12991.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12991.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12991.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-12991.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-12991.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-12991.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-12991.json","https://github.com/blackorbird/APT_REPORT/blob/58ced9a80e7974ea7713a678341fbd856a8e54d1/Exploit/EXP-LIST.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-12991.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0062","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12990","title":"Citrix SD-WAN 和 NetScaler SD-WAN 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3之前版本及NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需用户交互即可通过向受影响设备的管理接口发送特制的HTTP请求，利用路径遍历序列（如../）绕过访问限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统凭证等），进而可能导致完全控制目标设备。该漏洞CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重，影响范围包括Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.x及NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.x系列版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12990"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级到 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级到 10.0.8 或更高版本。补丁详情参见 Citrix 安全公告 CTX251987。如无法立即升级，可在 WAF/IPS 层面配置规则拦截对 /Collector/appliancesettings/applianceSettingsFileTransfer 路径的异常请求，并限制 www-data 用户对 webroot 目录的写入权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/search?searchQuery=%2A&lang=en&sort=relevance&prod=&pver=&ct=Security+Bulletin","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12990.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12990.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12990.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12990.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12990.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/citrix/netscaler_sd-wan/CVE-2019-12990.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12990.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12990.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2019-12990.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-12990.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-12990.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0062.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0062.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0408","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12989","title":"Citrix SD-WAN NetScaler SD-WAN SQL注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本存在 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备的 Web 管理界面发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在数据库查询中注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而窃取敏感配置数据、获取管理员权限甚至完全控制目标设备。该漏洞无需用户交互即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 SD-WAN 10.2.3 或 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12989"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:52Z","remediation":"将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级至 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级至 10.0.8 或更高版本，以修复 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或网络访问控制层面严格限制对 SD-WAN 管理界面的访问，仅允许可信管理 IP 连接，并监控 /sdwan/nitro/v1/config/get_package_file 接口的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153638/Citrix-SD-WAN-Appliance-10.2.2-Authentication-Bypass-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-32","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-12989","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12989.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12989.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12989.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12989.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12989.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/citrix/netscaler_sd-wan/CVE-2019-12989.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12989.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12989.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-12989.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-12989.yaml","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/2875884be3659183beedfe86700375a715fbe4e2/appsec-rules/crowdsecurity/vpatch-CVE-2019-12989.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0061","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12988","title":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-78），由于对用户输入验证不严格，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过特制请求向受影响设备注入任意操作系统命令，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本，无需任何权限即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12988"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:51Z","remediation":"将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级到 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级到 10.0.8 或更高版本。登录设备管理界面，进入 System > Administration > Software Updates 检查并安装更新。如无法立即升级，可在管理界面禁用 WAN 虚拟 IP 的未授权访问，并在网络边界防火墙限制对 SD-WAN 管理端口（如 443/8443）的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12988.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12988.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12988.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12988.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12988.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/citrix/netscaler_sd-wan/CVE-2019-12988.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12988.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12988.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2019-12988.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-12988.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-12988.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0061.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0061.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0060","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12987","title":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 存在 OS 命令注入漏洞，CVE 编号 CVE-2019-12987。该漏洞源于对用户输入验证不严格（CWE-78），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备的管理接口发送特制请求，在系统上下文中注入并执行任意操作系统命令。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互即可利用该漏洞，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。成功利用可导致目标系统完全受控，造成信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断。受影响版本包括 Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本。Citrix 已在 2019 年 7 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12987"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级到 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级到 10.0.8 或更高版本。补丁可通过 Citrix 官方支持站点（support.citrix.com）获取。如无法立即升级，建议在网络边界防火墙限制对 SD-WAN Center 管理界面的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接，并禁用非必要的管理端口暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12987.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12987.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12987.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12987.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12987.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/citrix/netscaler_sd-wan/CVE-2019-12987.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12987.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12987.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-12987.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-12987.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-12987.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0059","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12986","title":"Citrix NetScaler SD-WAN Center 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 存在 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。由于对用户输入验证不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向管理接口发送特制请求，在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本，无需用户交互即可利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Citrix 官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12986"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:51Z","remediation":"将 Citrix SD-WAN Center 升级至 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 升级至 10.0.8 或更高版本以修复命令注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制 SD-WAN Center 管理界面的访问权限，仅允许可信网络访问，并在网络边界部署入侵检测系统监控异常命令执行行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-20